evals.prompt:
Our Next.js app uses shadcn/ui and Tailwind; components/ui/card.tsx and components/ui/button.tsx exist. Restyle this plan card so it feels premium for a boutique hotel brand, without changing what it does, and write the result to PlanCard.tsx:

```tsx
export function PlanCard({ plan }) {
  return (
    <div className="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-6">
      <h3 className="text-xl font-semibold">{plan.name}</h3>
      <p className="text-gray-600">{plan.description}</p>
      <span className="text-2xl font-bold">{plan.price}</span>
      <button className="bg-blue-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded" onClick={plan.onSelect}>Book</button>
    </div>
  );
}
```
